@FinCore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5196

### Create a wallet; copy walletId from the response into the GET request.
POST {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "fe0bf5cf-b3ca-4d4f-8f9b-92c1d5f3eb1e",
  "currency": "BDT"
}

### Retrieve a wallet (replace this ID with the returned walletId).
GET {{FinCore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json
